### Search instruments by ticker or name
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/instruments?q=banco

### Find PAMP and its market data
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/instruments?q=pamp

### Find PGR, which has no market data
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/instruments?q=PGR

### Browse the whole market (first page)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/instruments

### Browse the next page using the nextCursor returned above
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/instruments?cursor=djE6MDpDVkg

### Reject a name filter shorter than three characters
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/instruments?name=ba
